        "Different pattern of facial dysmorphism"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "cri-du-chat-syndrome",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Deletion involves 5p region",
        "Characteristic high-pitched cat-like cry in infancy",
        "Distinctive facial features and severe intellectual disability"
      ]
    }
  ],
